            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Beck, JL and Porter, KA and Shaikhutdinov, RV and Au, SK and Mizukoshi, K and Miyamura, M and Ishida, H and Moroi,T and Tsukada, Y and Masuda, M. (2002). Impact of Seimic Risk on Lifetime Property Values. CUREE-Kajima Research Report CKIV-03. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/sc652yd0766",
